text "This week, the two of you will have some good conversations, and you will finally understand each other's feelings."
text "The two of you are like-minded, so if you can find common interests and go together to different places, you will surely have a meaningful, enjoyable time together."
text "However, you must not get ahead of yourself. If you attempt to take control, it may only serve to distance the two of you."
text "Rather than being too serious, spend your time together as friends."
text "Your lucky items are: Stuffed toy and picnic sheets."
text "Your lucky color is: white."
